<title>BELGIUM: EU sugar panel cuts cane molasses duty. [CORRECTED 15:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>EU sugar panel cuts cane molasses duty. [CORRECTED 15:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union sugar management committee on Wednesday cut the import tariff on cane molasses due to an increase (corrects from fall) in the world price, an EU official said.</p>
<p>&quot;The small levy which had been 0.11 Ecus per 100 kg was cut to 0.06 Ecus per 100 kg based on a reference price of 8.15 Ecus per 100 kg reflecting the world market,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The duty on beet molasses remains suspended at zero with a reference price of 11.13 Ecus per 100 kg.</p>
</text>
